{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>He shall dwell alone.</b> He is forbidden to have marital relations, for relations aggravate his condition. <b>Outside the camp shall be his dwelling.</b> For this disease spreads to people who are regularly in his company." "<b>Outside the camp shall be his dwelling.</b> His dwelling is impure. From here they said: if the impure one sits under the tree and the pure one stands, the pure one becomes impure. If the pure one sits under the tree and the impure one stands, the pure one remains pure."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:00.468892031Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}